sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Website (React)
  participant A as API (FastAPI)
  participant S as SQLite store
  participant G as GitHub REST API
  U->>W: paste commit / PR URL, click Analyze
  W->>A: POST /analyze {repo_url, commit_sha | pr_url}
  A->>A: parse_target (400 on a bad URL or SHA)
  A->>S: create analysis (status running)
  A-->>W: 202 {id}
  W->>W: navigate to /results/{id}
  par background job
    A->>S: cached result for repo + full sha?
    alt cache hit
      S-->>A: stored result
    else cache miss
      A->>G: GET commit / compare (changed files)
      A->>G: GET raw file before and after
      G-->>A: Java sources (or 404 / 429 rate limit / 5xx)
      A->>A: extract, pair, metrics, zones, models, score
    end
    A->>S: finish(result) or fail(friendly message)
  and polling
    loop every 800 ms until done or failed
      W->>A: GET /analysis/{id}
      A-->>W: {status, stage}
    end
  end
  A-->>W: {status: done, result}
  W-->>U: gauge, counts, method table, drawer, downloads
